# Statistical data sets finder

List only data that exists, and describe it by measure, unit, period, source and update time. A chart and an export of raw readings are different things and need different labels. For example, “Daily energy use, kWh” is a statistic. It is not a promise of per-minute meter readings. Scope, result count, empty states, focus and the no-JavaScript fallback follow the [shared finder behaviour](../finder.html#finder-shared-contract).

## When to use it

Use it for a catalogue of native statistics or genuine exports. Include the measure, unit, period, source and update time.

## Home Assistant boundary

This reference does not create an export endpoint or promise raw meter history. Never list a generated download before it exists. Keep missing intervals, units and the actual aggregation level.

